## Open questions you should remain honest about (Anthropic)

Multi-agent decomposition (explicit testing/QA/refactor personas) vs one general coder **still empirically open**. Web-demo harness may partially generalize to research/finance/other long-horizons—**adapt artifacts**, retain **incremental externally visible state.**

